                             requests using this proxy.                         
                               -sni                Target TLS SNI,              
                             does not support FUZZ keyword                      
                               -timeout            HTTP request                 
                             timeout in seconds. (default: 10)                  
                               -u                  Target URL                   
                               -x                  Proxy URL                    
                             (SOCKS5 or HTTP). For example:                     
                             http://127.0.0.1:8080 or                           
                             socks5://127.0.0.1:8080                            
                                                                                
